        <p class="text-white/90 mb-4">Discover where your Reading law firm stands in Google Search and AI search engines. We will identify the technical issues, content gaps, and local SEO opportunities specific to your practice areas and locations.</p>
        <a href="/seo-audit-reading/">Book a Consultation</a>
      </div>

